          <p class="lead" style="margin-inline: auto;">
            Families often ask, "how much to euthanize a dog at home?" or "what is the in home pet euthanasia cost?" The total home euthanasia cost for a dog or cat depends primarily on the weight of the pet and your location in California. The base ranges below are estimates and include the home visit, gentle sedation, and the euthanasia procedure itself.
          </p>
