                <td class="price-col">Starting at $550</td>
                <td>Home visit, exam, sedation, peaceful passing, gentle transport for group cremation. (Optional fur clipping or clay paw print).</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Euthanasia + Private Cremation</strong></td>
                <td class="price-col">Starting at $750</td>
                <td>Home visit, exam, sedation, peaceful passing, gentle transport for individual cremation. Ashes returned via shipping delivery (hand delivery available for additional fee).</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Travel Fee</strong></td>
                <td class="price-col">Varies</td>
